title: "Second Brain Starter Kit: Claude Code as a personal second brain and working assistant"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dziatkovskii
    given-names: Anton
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7408-3054"
    affiliation: "Palo Alto AI Research Lab"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Palo-Alto-AI-Research-Lab/second-brain-starter-kit"
url: "https://github.com/Palo-Alto-AI-Research-Lab/second-brain-starter-kit"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - second brain
  - personal knowledge management
  - AI agents
  - Claude Code
  - CRM
  - Obsidian
abstract: >-
  A portable starter kit for running an LLM coding agent as a personal second brain
  and working assistant: a seed message for the first session, bootstrap instructions
  written for the agent itself, working principles, a library of slash-command skills,
  note templates, and a markdown CRM where each contact is a file with a warmth-scoring
  engine and a gated outbound path. Published as method rather than data — the authors'
  daily system with personal content removed and examples replaced by invented ones.
